  "consultEarly": "If these symptoms continue, consider talking to a healthcare professional.",
  "@consultEarly": {
    "description": "Gentle prompt for early-consultation-urgency conditions. Deliberately names no medical department (many of these filters, e.g. vertigo, aren't an eye complaint) — #76 review S4. Must not alarm or over-promise."
  },
  "consultEmergency": "If these symptoms appear suddenly, seek medical care right away.",
