    "description": "Full disclaimer shown in the UI (right-hand adjustment column, always shown with the consult note for both advanced filters and experience presets) alongside every consult note, stating this app does not diagnose and has not had medical review, with a citation to sensus's own Medical notes doc (#76 review M2, wording clarified in re-review nit: names sensus as a simulation library and its docs as the source). The actual URL is shown separately as selectable text (ConsultNoticeBlock / ConsultDisclaimerFooter), not embedded in this string."
  },
  "consultDisclaimerShort": "Not a diagnosis; not medically reviewed. Source: sensus Medical notes",
  "@consultDisclaimerShort": {
    "description": "Compact disclaimer burned into the exported PNG caption (#76 review M1/M2, re-review M1'). Must fit both the non-diagnosis disclaimer AND the citation in one short line — kept short so the caption band stays small. The UI uses the longer consultDisclaimer instead."
  },
